    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/eb0626278b3f2f5f4a4202fb3f06e4ad.webp?t=1749843259\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/53cd1a1b97acaf1d90d337621164b110.poster.avif?t=1749843259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/53cd1a1b97acaf1d90d337621164b110.webm?t=1749843259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/53cd1a1b97acaf1d90d337621164b110.mp4?t=1749843259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TSUNDERE MILFIN</strong> is an unusual visual novel with economic clinker simulation gameplay, Match3 levels and dialogue with a cute Muslim woman :3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been interviewed for your dream job at the <strong>TSUNDERE MILFIN</strong> investment company, and now you have to win the love and respect of your strictly ladyboss Areesha. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find yourself in various difficult working situations: get stuck with Areesha in the elevator, slip on the wet floor, find a secret gift from a secret admirer and more! Can you cope with these incredibly difficult situations, while earning money! Areesha is a sweet <strong>Muslim girl</strong> who loves and <strong>honors the traditions of her religion</strong>. She is an excellent specialist in her field, but sometimes she is so lacking in attention...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/333be3d6c3b5c5b66c5aa943a7b2cdde.poster.avif?t=1749843259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/333be3d6c3b5c5b66c5aa943a7b2cdde.webm?t=1749843259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/333be3d6c3b5c5b66c5aa943a7b2cdde.mp4?t=1749843259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2665Features\u2665:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles Match3 will help you connect with Areesha. She really likes this game. She will definitely be impressed with your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel: learn more about working at TSUNDERE MILFIN, and of course get to know your cute Muslim colleague better :3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humorous Office Situations: The game is set in a frantic office environment, with humor and unexpected situations that allow you to relax.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Development: The relationship between the player and his stern boss is central to the story, and the player's choice affects the development of their relationship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work-Conviction Balance: The game explores the idea of balancing the demands of work with personal beliefs and values, a topic that is both relatable and thought-provoking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth Live2d animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated cute backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning soundtrack by the best lofi artists: G374, smth.nothing, Zephyr Deer, bluemoon.music, of4gatto_feelin, Meloxen, bluemoon.music, 09eleven \u2665 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay involves solving challenging match-3 puzzles that will help the player win the trust and respect of the boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TSUNDERE MILFIN</strong> offers a unique and engaging experience that combines match-3 puzzle gameplay, visual novel and office humor to create a one-of-a-kind game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not contain non-tolerance, any religious of any political organizations and anything like that. Only love and mutual understanding. <strong>Make Match3, not war \u2665</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/3c0b1386deaf769bebbb600e718f182c.poster.avif?t=1749843259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/3c0b1386deaf769bebbb600e718f182c.webm?t=1749843259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/3c0b1386deaf769bebbb600e718f182c.mp4?t=1749843259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
