t and respect of the boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TSUNDERE MILFIN</strong> offers a unique and engaging experience that combines match-3 puzzle gameplay, visual novel and office humor to create a one-of-a-kind game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not contain non-tolerance, any religious of any political organizations and anything like that. Only love and mutual understanding. <strong>Make Match3, not war \u2665</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/3c0b1386deaf769bebbb600e718f182c.poster.avif?t=1749843259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/3c0b1386deaf769bebbb600e718f182c.webm?t=1749843259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307220/extras/3c0b1386deaf769bebbb600e718f182c.mp4?t=1749843259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
